<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="lastwave_logo.png" name="LastWave" pubkey="" timestamp="1789417566" url="https://iamsrishanth.github.io/LastWave-Native/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>LastWave updates — Hi-Res Lossless music streaming and player for Android. Official release APKs, byte-identical to the upstream GitHub Releases, so F-Droid and Droid-ify users can install and auto-update LastWave.</description></repo><application id="com.lastwave.app"><id>com.lastwave.app</id><added>2026-09-14</added><lastupdated>2026-09-14</lastupdated><name>LastWave</name><summary>Hi-Res Lossless music streaming &amp; player with real-time synced lyrics</summary><desc>LastWave is a native Android music streaming app engineered for audiophiles.
It delivers studio-quality Hi-Res Lossless FLAC (up to 24-bit/192kHz) and Opus
playback, offline downloads with full embedded metadata, kinetic real-time
synchronized lyrics, smart algorithmic playlist generation, and automatic
scrobbling across all your devices.

Built around Material 3 Expressive with an uncompromising audio fidelity
pipeline: bit-perfect USB DAC output, FFmpeg software decoding for every
supported codec, and Android Auto support.

&lt;b&gt;Features&lt;/b&gt;
* Hi-Res Lossless FLAC streaming (up to 24-bit/192kHz) and Opus playback
* Bit-perfect USB DAC output routing
* Real-time kinetic synced lyrics (LRCLIB)
* Offline downloads with embedded metadata and cover art
* Smart algorithmic playlist generation
* Last.fm scrobbling across devices
* Android Auto and Cast support
* Home-screen Now Playing widget

&lt;b&gt;About this repository&lt;/b&gt;
This custom F-Droid repo redistributes the official release APKs so that
F-Droid and Droid-ify users can install and auto-update LastWave. APKs are
byte-identical to the upstream GitHub Releases (same signing certificate).
